Klas 0.5 is a big update:
• "Today" tab: the day's lessons, a tap to mark one taught, and who owes.
• Home-screen widgets: today's lessons and shortcuts.
• Undo cancelling, moving and marking lessons, payments and archiving.
• Backups: a password, a weekly copy to a folder you choose, and a preview before restoring.
• App lock; names and amounts stay off the lock screen.
• Reports and statements as PDF.
• 25 languages.
